		"description": "<p>1 Action, Reach: 6. Remove Soul Touched from the target and choose 1 of the following effects. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing:</p><ul><li><strong>Warp.</strong> Teleport to a space adjacent to the target.</li><li><strong>Chain.</strong> A Huge or smaller target is Restrained, 1 turn.</li></ul><p>When you use an Iron Rite or Protect, you can make a melee weapon attack as part of the same Action, ignoring Rushed Attack rules.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants two separate Rite features — Iron Rite: Warp and Iron Rite: Chain. Each checks and removes your Soul Touched on the target.</em></p><p><em>[M] The free melee weapon attack after an Iron Rite or Protect is rolled by hand.</em></p><p><em>[M] Characters created before this update: delete and re-add Iron Rites to receive them.</em></p>",
